title: "Machine Learning, From Scratch: A theory-first course"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2024-01-01"
url: "https://github.com/Lourdhu02/machine-learning-advanced"
abstract: >
  A theory-first machine learning course: derive the math, draw the diagram,
  implement the algorithm from scratch in NumPy — not by gluing together
  scikit-learn. Covers linear models, trees and ensembles, Bayes and kNN,
  clustering, dimensionality reduction, MLPs, CNNs, RNNs/LSTMs, attention,
  and transformers, with hands-on labs.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - from scratch
  - NumPy
  - pedagogy
  - linear regression
  - neural networks
  - transformers
